{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Reorderable live setlist manager for REAPER. Decouples show order from timeline layout using regions. Supports linked songs (auto-chain), persistent setlists, and JSON export/import. Requires ReaImGui extension.\par}
